OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,FA man from Ceredigion says he's been
OL,7,Fconfined to his kitchen for over two
OL,8,Fand a half years due to the stairlift
OL,9,Fin his home being broken.
OL,11,FPeter Bakewell, from Llanfarian, is a
OL,12,Fwheelchair user and has lived in the
OL,13,Fsame property for more than a decade.
OL,15,FWhen he first moved in, it was managed
OL,16,Fby Ceredigion County Council, but it
OL,17,Fhas since been acquired by Barcud
OL,18,FHousing Association.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,FMr Bakewell says despite many efforts,
OL,7,Fneither the local authority nor Barcud
OL,8,Fhave come round to replace the
OL,9,Fcondemned stairlift.
OL,11,F"I have to do everything in the
OL,12,Fkitchen. Toiletries, everything in one
OL,13,Froom, where I'm supposed to eat. It's
OL,14,Fnot very hygienic."
OL,16,FMr Bakewell says he hasn't been able
OL,17,Fto have a proper wash in three years
OL,18,Fas the wet room is upstairs.
OL,26,@sD@AOUvD@SO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,F"I've asked people, is there somewhere-
OL,7,F anywhere- I can be taken to have a
OL,8,Fshower."
OL,10,FHe says he has also been unable to
OL,11,Fsleep in his own bed.
OL,13,F"I don't sleep, I just cat nap here,
OL,14,For with my head against the wall.
OL,16,F"I've got my own wet room upstairs,
OL,17,FI've got a nice comfy bed. I've done
OL,18,Feverything in my power, used up all my
OL,19,Fsavings, but I'm not receiving any
OL,20,Fhelp from anybody."
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,FHe feels that he's been "completely
OL,7,Fblanked" by both the local authority
OL,8,Fand housing association.
OL,10,F"I just want my life back for the few
OL,11,Fyears I have left.
OL,13,F"I'm perfectly happy here, the house
OL,14,Fis adequate, but I'm not getting help
OL,15,Fwith anything. I've even offered to
OL,16,Fpay for the stairlift myself."
OL,18,FDiscussing the emotional toll, Mr
OL,19,FBakewell said: "This has ripped me
OL,20,Fapart."
OL,26,@nD@YOUoD@HO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
