PN,43705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,FITV Cymru Wales spoke to Alex
OL,7,FHarrison, a representative from
OL,8,FDisability Wales, who called Mr
OL,9,FBakewell's situation 'shameful'.
OL,11,FShe said: "I don't think any of us
OL,12,Fwould want to move out of our house
OL,13,Fafter making it our home for so long.
OL,14,Fand in this situation it seems silly
OL,15,Fthat they want to move him to another
OL,16,Fhouse which they have to make
OL,17,Faccessible, rather than just ensuring
OL,18,Fhis current house that he wants to
OL,19,Fstay in is accessible for him."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,F"He's spent time and money making that
OL,7,Fhis home, and now he's being told to
OL,8,Fjust move. It really is shameful."
OL,10,FShe advised: "I'd tell him to get in
OL,11,Ftouch with the Disability Law Service
OL,12,Fwhich provides free legal advice to
OL,13,Fdisabled people. We'd also recommend
OL,14,Fgetting in touch with Citizens Advice."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
