PN,43707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,FBarcud Housing Association told ITV
OL,7,FWales in a statement that its
OL,8,F"approach is guided by independent
OL,9,Fprofessional assessments, including
OL,10,Frecommendations from specialist
OL,11,Fhealthcare teams and Occupational
OL,12,FTherapists.
OL,14,F"Where a property cannot be reasonably
OL,15,For safely adapted to meet a tenant's
OL,16,Fcurrent or future needs, we will
OL,17,Fexplore all viable options, including
OL,18,Fidentifying alternative homes that are
OL,19,Fappropriate for the individual's
OL,20,Fcircumstances.
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,F"We recognise that moving home can be
OL,7,Fa difficult and emotional experience,
OL,8,Fand we are committed to supporting
OL,9,Ftenants throughout the process with
OL,10,Fsensitivity and understanding."
OL,12,FCeredigion County Council said it is
OL,13,Fin touch with the relevant parties but
OL,14,Fcannot comment on individual cases.
OL,16,FMr Bakewell hopes for a resolution as
OL,17,Fsoon as possible, claiming his current
OL,18,Fliving arrangements are having a
OL,19,Fdetrimental effect on his health.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@_O]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G8/9
