PN,43709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785417510
OL,3,CWheelchair user says broken stairlift
OL,4,Chas forced him to live in kitchen
OL,6,F"All I want is to renew my stairlift
OL,7,Fand help with my ceiling hoists so I
OL,8,Fcan get upstairs and go to bed. Have a
OL,9,Fshower and go to the toilet. That's
OL,10,Fall I need and all I've ever asked
OL,11,Ffor."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@EO]
